  "question": {
    "text": "Let the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is continuous&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then, the value of the function&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is"
  },
